# Delay sweep (no CPS column): sweep server response delay at a fixed external load.
#
# Usage:
#   tools/events-schedule.sh tools/events-schedule-examples/delay.driver

Timeline(s)   vault:RESPONSE_DELAY_MS   mark-metrics
0             0                         start
30            50                        -
60            100                       -
90            200                       -
120           500                       -
150           1000                      -
180           2000                      -
210           0                         end
